rtners, as well as client-led advice and solutions. The company's Capital Markets segment offers advisory and origination, sales and trading, lending and financing, and transaction banking services to corporations, institutional clients, asset managers, private equity firms, and governments. The company was founded in 1864 and is based in Toronto, Canada.","fullTimeEmployees":101269,"city":"Toronto","country":"Canada","website":"https://www.rbc.com","industry":"Banks - Diversified","sector":"Financial Services"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-31"}